--- PREAMBLE ---

This license exists because software licensing has become a weapon,
not a shield. The goal is simple:

1. Use this code. Freely. Even in closed-source products.
2. Ensure that the required attribution and copyright notices are preserved and easily accessible.
3. If you train an AI on this code and it memorizes parts of it,
   don't pretend the AI wrote it. Credit the original.

No lawyer-ese. No traps. Just mutual respect.

If you can't handle that, don't use the code.

